{"4998380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tower Of Legends", "steam_appid": 4998380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5087450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <u><strong>Tower Of Legends</strong></u>, you'll climb a mysterious tower packed with colorful environments, fast-paced parkour, clever puzzles, dangerous monsters, and exciting discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/72be291e42226532449f47dc943ec230.poster.avif?t=1787575412\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/72be291e42226532449f47dc943ec230.webm?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/72be291e42226532449f47dc943ec230.mp4?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your movement as you jump across moving platforms, dodge deadly traps, climb towering walls, and conquer skill-based obstacle courses. Every stage introduces fresh mechanics and new challenges, keeping the adventure exciting from start to finish.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/41b77efef4d20015be687a085b87a4e8.poster.avif?t=1787575412\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/41b77efef4d20015be687a085b87a4e8.webm?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/41b77efef4d20015be687a085b87a4e8.mp4?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not climbing alone. A flying drone companion helps you battle powerful monsters using a variety of unique projectiles. Collect coins throughout your journey to unlock and purchase new ammunition, giving you more ways to overcome increasingly difficult enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/83cdb44785b9216700421c006ddf1cd7.poster.avif?t=1787575412\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/83cdb44785b9216700421c006ddf1cd7.webm?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/83cdb44785b9216700421c006ddf1cd7.mp4?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant locations, uncover hidden paths, solve environmental puzzles, and discover secrets scattered throughout the tower. Every level is carefully handcrafted to reward curiosity, precision, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/58d493c61df2c879fab3c0311e6d7f78.avif?t=1787575412\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras_big/58d493c61df2c879fab3c0311e6d7f78.webp?t=1787575412 width=1560 height=953 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/5f9415dc13de8f7c753a08eb90f4d1a3.avif?t=1787575412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras_big/5f9415dc13de8f7c753a08eb90f4d1a3.webp?t=1787575412 width=1560 height=953 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🪜Climb through <strong>10 unique Levels</strong> and <strong>45  stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃Fast-paced parkour with precise platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️Battle dangerous monsters with your flying drone companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯Unlock and equip <strong>8 unique projectile types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠Solve creative puzzles and discover hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰Collect coins to unlock new ammunition and improve your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨Explore colorful environments filled with personality and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆Designed for players who love platforming, exploration, and rewarding gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think You're Up for the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the colorful world fool you some stages are <strong>brutally challenging</strong>. They demand perfect timing, quick reflexes, and plenty of determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can't beat a level... don't blame the tower. 😏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every obstacle is there to be conquered, every challenge can be mastered, and every victory feels earned. Whether you're chasing the perfect jump, uncovering every secret, or defeating the toughest monsters, each step brings you closer to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The tower is waiting. How far can you climb?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>I'll </strong>See you at the top. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <u><strong>Tower Of Legends</strong></u>, you'll climb a mysterious tower packed with colorful environments, fast-paced parkour, clever puzzles, dangerous monsters, and exciting discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/72be291e42226532449f47dc943ec230.poster.avif?t=1787575412\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/72be291e42226532449f47dc943ec230.webm?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/72be291e42226532449f47dc943ec230.mp4?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your movement as you jump across moving platforms, dodge deadly traps, climb towering walls, and conquer skill-based obstacle courses. Every stage introduces fresh mechanics and new challenges, keeping the adventure exciting from start to finish.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/41b77efef4d20015be687a085b87a4e8.poster.avif?t=1787575412\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/41b77efef4d20015be687a085b87a4e8.webm?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/41b77efef4d20015be687a085b87a4e8.mp4?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not climbing alone. A flying drone companion helps you battle powerful monsters using a variety of unique projectiles. Collect coins throughout your journey to unlock and purchase new ammunition, giving you more ways to overcome increasingly difficult enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/83cdb44785b9216700421c006ddf1cd7.poster.avif?t=1787575412\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/83cdb44785b9216700421c006ddf1cd7.webm?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/83cdb44785b9216700421c006ddf1cd7.mp4?t=1787575412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant locations, uncover hidden paths, solve environmental puzzles, and discover secrets scattered throughout the tower. Every level is carefully handcrafted to reward curiosity, precision, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/58d493c61df2c879fab3c0311e6d7f78.avif?t=1787575412\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras_big/58d493c61df2c879fab3c0311e6d7f78.webp?t=1787575412 width=1560 height=953 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras/5f9415dc13de8f7c753a08eb90f4d1a3.avif?t=1787575412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/extras_big/5f9415dc13de8f7c753a08eb90f4d1a3.webp?t=1787575412 width=1560 height=953 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🪜Climb through <strong>10 unique Levels</strong> and <strong>45  stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃Fast-paced parkour with precise platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️Battle dangerous monsters with your flying drone companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯Unlock and equip <strong>8 unique projectile types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠Solve creative puzzles and discover hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰Collect coins to unlock new ammunition and improve your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨Explore colorful environments filled with personality and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆Designed for players who love platforming, exploration, and rewarding gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think You're Up for the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the colorful world fool you some stages are <strong>brutally challenging</strong>. They demand perfect timing, quick reflexes, and plenty of determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can't beat a level... don't blame the tower. 😏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every obstacle is there to be conquered, every challenge can be mastered, and every victory feels earned. Whether you're chasing the perfect jump, uncovering every secret, or defeating the toughest monsters, each step brings you closer to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The tower is waiting. How far can you climb?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>I'll </strong>See you at the top. </p>", "short_description": "Climb a mysterious tower packed with thrilling parkour, clever puzzles, dangerous monsters, hidden secrets, and rewarding exploration. Master skill-based platforming, battle with your flying drone, and conquer 10 unique worlds across 45 challenging stages. Can you reach the top?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Marathi, Tamil, Telugu<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998380/cdf33bcd1